{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上角的大字最先进入视线，先看到紫色“那些气不该忍”，随后看到蓝色“没了力气”；正文次之，右上角目录和下方音符动画不是主要文字入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"只抓到一个人已经没了力气，具体遭遇和当下处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"能感到有一股不愿再忍的气、不甘；具体是委屈还是愤怒，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"正文中的“委屈和火气都在”“还想替自己争口气”，以及柔和的歌唱仍像被压力推着走、仿佛不愿就这样算了的具体状态。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"核心意思分散在大标题、副标题和正文里，处境与感受之间的关系需要拼接才能理解。\",\n    \"放大的“那些气不该忍”表达态度，“没了力气”表达状态，单独都不足以交代完整处境和感受。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "882cc279-c172-4950-974f-42efb8fcdf6e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T022412207451Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:24:39.676619+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b1f4b33641f7afcd880e75f30e3d5ba21712a117b61d469ce112f907824b274f", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we